---
name: Escritório role
description: Office user role with farm-scoped read access, stock management, reports, notifications
type: feature
---
- Table: escritorios (id, user_id, nome, email, telefone, fazenda_id, ativo)
- RLS: uses is_escritorio() and get_escritorio_fazenda_id() security definer functions
- Can: view dashboard, retiros, pastos, lancamentos, QR codes, add stock, view reports, receive notifications
- Cannot: approve transfers, manage users, edit fazendas, change settings
- Default password: Consubov@2025 (set automatically via create-user edge function)
- Route: /escritorio
- Admin manages via /admin/escritorios
